        {
          "text": "Kenyo Were owaco ni, “Aka onyo pama walacweyo ji i cal mawan, aka jowocale wan; aka weyi jowodhum rec ma nam, winyin ma koyo kodi ogwaŋe ma peco kodi madudi.” ",
