            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Were ocweyo ji i cal pere; ocweyo jo ma cwo kodi ma mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Were omiyo jo silwany to waco ni, “Nywol win nyithindho kweth, ŋey nyikway win jowobedi i piny gibe to jodhumo. Dhum win rec ma nam, winyin ma malo kodi kisi cwec makwo ma wotho i piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiyo win dudi manywolo nyinge kodi manywolo olemo paka cemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ri ogwaŋe kodi winyin, amiyo lum kodi boke dudi paka cemo.” Aka obedo ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were oneno kisi gima go oyido ocweyo, aka neni, oyido ber swa. Piny oyutho to piny yawere. Meno obedo ndelo mar'aucel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
